# Derived planes only: rebuildable from the committed index and the
# source systems. NEVER add `*` here: `.fux/index/`, `.fux/sources/`,
# `.fux/fetchers/` and `.fux/decoders/` are committed, and a blanket
# ignore would drop them
# from git silently. `fux doctor` checks exactly that.
